n-reduction\">28-df-distributional-levin-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ed46051194e5ee\" href=\"?note=c2ed46051194e5ee\" title=\"28-df-average-polynomial-time\">28-df-average-polynomial-time</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 18.8; fixed-length separator completion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"367–368"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"393–394"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,D^U\">\\(U,D^U\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"343af549f6fb6f36\" href=\"?note=343af549f6fb6f36\" title=\"28-df-distributional-bounded-halting\">28-df-distributional-bounded-halting</a> 的固定有效有限转移表编码；其解码和有限运行检验在描述与一元步数的多项式时间完成。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{distNP}\">\\(\\operatorname{distNP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a9600026c66a6d0\" href=\"?note=2a9600026c66a6d0\" title=\"28-df-distnp\">28-df-distnp</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\">\\(\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ad248c715bc0bb7\" href=\"?note=8ad248c715bc0bb7\" title=\"28-df-distributional-levin-reduction\">28-df-distributional-levin-reduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{distP}\">\\(\\operatorname{distP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c2ed46051194e5ee\" href=\"?note=c2ed46051194e5ee\" title=\"28-df-average-polynomial-time\">28-df-average-polynomial-time</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle U,D^U\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distNP},\\qquad\\forall\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distNP}\\quad\\langle L,D\\rangle\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\langle U,D^U\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle U,D^U\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distNP},\\qquad\\forall\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distNP}\\quad\\langle L,D\\rangle\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\langle U,D^U\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle U,D^U\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{distNP}\\subseteq\\operatorname{distP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle U,D^U\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{distP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{distNP}\\subseteq\\operatorname{distP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应Levin完全性主机制：压平概率尖峰，再将可逆压缩串与固定识别机、足够一元时间一起编码。上游所补分隔符只占O(log n)位，机器码与时间选择概率损失为多项式；但本次未完整重建峰消除、反向解码以及全归约支配证明，故本条是待证明核验的来源对应记录，不能作已核验依赖。特别注意原书Lemma18.9的输入长度与输出长度索引有印刷不一致，本条没有将其错误字面公式作为前提。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 18.8; fixed-length separator completion；印刷页 367–368；PDF 页 393–394。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第18章的 Levin Distributional Completeness，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-distributional-bounded-halting","status":"resolved","id":"343af549f6fb6f36","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distnp","status":"resolved","id":"2a9600026c66a6d0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"